                              UN/EDIFACT

                 Standard segments directory for test purposes

       This is not a UNECE publication. It is a hand written sample that
       follows the layout of the UNTDID batch files.

     Change indicators

     a plus sign (+)    for an addition

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       BGM  BEGINNING OF MESSAGE

       Function: To indicate the type and function of a message.

010    1004 DOCUMENT IDENTIFIER                        C    1 an..35

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       DGS  DANGEROUS GOODS

       Function: To identify dangerous goods.

010    7124 UNITED NATIONS DANGEROUS GOODS (UNDG) IDENTIFIER   C    1 an..4

020    C223 DANGEROUS GOODS SHIPMENT FLASHPOINT        C    1
       7106  Shipment flashpoint degree                C      n..3
       6411  Measurement unit code                     C      an..3

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       FTX  FREE TEXT

       Function: To provide free form or coded text information.

010    4451 TEXT SUBJECT CODE QUALIFIER                M    1 an..3

020    4440 FREE TEXT                                  C    1 an..70

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       NAD  NAME AND ADDRESS

       Function: To specify the name and address of a party.

010    3035 PARTY FUNCTION CODE QUALIFIER              M    1 an..3

020    3164 CITY NAME                                  C    1 an..35

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       RFF  REFERENCE

       Function: To specify a reference.

010    C506 REFERENCE                                  M    1
       1153  Reference code qualifier                  M      an..3
       1154  Reference identifier                      C      an..70

----------------------------------------------------------------------

       TAX  DUTY/TAX/FEE DETAILS

       Function: To specify relevant duty/tax/fee information.

010    5283 DUTY OR TAX OR FEE FUNCTION CODE QUALIFIER M    1 an..3
